{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HISTORY</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While looking for a place to rest during your trip, you find yourself invited to spend the night in the castle of the mysterious Baron Fetuccini. Arriving at the castle, you discover a nightmare from which it seems impossible to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore varied environments in a non-linear way, solve puzzles and manage your resources carefully in this survival horror game where the slightest encounter can be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time is also a precious resource. Be careful, when night falls, you could find yourself facing the most dangerous threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SOLVE THE MYSTERIES OF THE CASTLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet other characters who are also trapped on the island. Helping them may help you unlock the secrets behind the mysterious Funskin project.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3232650?t=1735475771","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1735475771","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232650/066ab2dfb8b104c50b952e8b51811a6026d6fc5c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1735475771","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232650/066ab2dfb8b104c50b952e8b51811a6026d6fc5c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1735475771","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains sytlised depcitions of violence and gore, as well as slightly foul language."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HISTORY</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While looking for a place to rest during your trip, you find yourself invited to spend the night in the castle of the mysterious Baron Fetuccini. Arriving at the castle, you discover a nightmare from which it seems impossible to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore varied environments in a non-linear way, solve puzzles and manage your resources carefully in this survival horror game where the slightest encounter can be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time is also a precious resource. Be careful, when night falls, you could find yourself facing the most dangerous threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SOLVE THE MYSTERIES OF THE CASTLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet other characters who are also trapped on the island. Helping them may help you unlock the secrets behind the mysterious Funskin project.</p>","developers":["Studio Richoux"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232650/header.jpg?t=1735475771","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"The Funskin Project","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 780<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Studio Richoux"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nMedo","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt\nSchimpfw\u00f6rte","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","req